---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Rizki RN — Gaming & Esports Community Manager"
  description="I build and run communities for games and digital products through community operations, content, creator programs, events, and tournaments."
>

  <!-- ============================================================
       HERO
       ============================================================ -->

  <section class="notebook-hero">
    <div class="site-shell">

      <div class="page-meta hero-meta">

        <div class="page-meta-item">
          <span class="page-meta-label">CURRENTLY /</span>
          <span>CrossFire Legends</span>
        </div>

        <div class="page-meta-item">
          <span class="page-meta-label">BASED /</span>
          <span>Indonesia</span>
        </div>

        <div class="page-meta-item">
          <span class="page-meta-label">UPDATED /</span>
          <span>Sep 2026</span>
        </div>

      </div>


      <h1 class="hero-heading">

        <span class="line">
          I build and run
        </span>

        <span class="line">
          communities people
        </span>

        <span class="line">
          <span class="marker marker-double">
            actually participate in.
          </span>
        </span>

      </h1>


      <div class="hero-copy-row">

        <p class="hero-intro">
          I work across community operations, content, creator programs,
          events, and tournaments for games and digital products.
        </p>

        <a href="#work" class="text-link hero-link">
          Selected Work
          <span class="arrow">↓</span>
        </a>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       01 — CROSSFIRE LEGENDS
       ============================================================ -->

  <section id="work" class="project-feature">
    <div class="site-shell">

      <div class="project-heading-row">

        <span class="project-index">
          01 / CURRENT
        </span>

        <h2 class="project-title">
          CrossFire<br />
          Legends
        </h2>

        <span class="project-date">
          2025 — NOW
        </span>

      </div>


      <p class="project-subtitle">
        Helping build the Indonesian community
        <span class="marker">
          from the beginning.
        </span>
      </p>


      <!-- Main CFL image -->

      <figure class="pasted-photo rotate-right">

        <span class="photo-tape top-center"></span>

        <img
          src="/images/cflc.jpg"
          alt="CrossFire Legends community and esports activities"
          loading="lazy"
        />

        <figcaption class="photo-caption">
          current work ↗
        </figcaption>

      </figure>


      <!-- Project context -->

      <div class="project-details">

        <div class="project-description">

          <p>
            I joined CrossFire Legends while its community was still
            being built and now handle much of the day-to-day community
            operation in Indonesia.
          </p>

          <p>
            That means managing player-facing communities, running
            weekly activities, supporting tournaments, working with
            creators, handling player communication, and bringing
            recurring feedback back to the team.
          </p>

          <p>
            The goal isn't just getting people into a Discord or
            Facebook group. The work is about giving players something
            to do once they're there.
          </p>

        </div>


        <dl class="project-facts">

          <div class="project-fact">
            <dt>Role</dt>
            <dd>Community Manager</dd>
          </div>

          <div class="project-fact">
            <dt>Market</dt>
            <dd>Indonesia</dd>
          </div>

          <div class="project-fact">
            <dt>Regional</dt>
            <dd>Southeast Asia</dd>
          </div>

          <div class="project-fact">
            <dt>Channels</dt>
            <dd>Discord · Facebook · WhatsApp</dd>
          </div>

          <div class="project-fact">
            <dt>Focus</dt>
            <dd>Community · Creators · Esports</dd>
          </div>

        </dl>

      </div>


      <!-- What I handle -->

      <div class="project-capabilities">

        <div class="capability">

          <span class="capability-number">
            01
          </span>

          <div>
            <h3>Community Operations</h3>

            <p>
              Day-to-day player communication, moderation, questions,
              announcements, and engagement across community channels.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="capability">

          <span class="capability-number">
            02
          </span>

          <div>
            <h3>Weekly Activities</h3>

            <p>
              Quizzes, comment-based events, mini tournaments,
              fast scrimmages, and other recurring activities.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="capability">

          <span class="capability-number">
            03
          </span>

          <div>
            <h3>Creator Program</h3>

            <p>
              Program communication, creator submissions, work recaps,
              and contacting creators who qualify for rewards.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="capability">

          <span class="capability-number">
            04
          </span>

          <div>
            <h3>Tournaments</h3>

            <p>
              Community-facing tournament operations, participant
              communication, promotion, and player support across
              Indonesia and Southeast Asia.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="capability">

          <span class="capability-number">
            05
          </span>

          <div>
            <h3>Player Feedback</h3>

            <p>
              Collect recurring issues, questions, bugs, and sentiment
              from players and communicate useful feedback internally.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="capability">

          <span class="capability-number">
            06
          </span>

          <div>
            <h3>Player Communication</h3>

            <p>
              Turn game, event, campaign, and tournament information
              into communication players can understand and act on.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>


      <!-- ======================================================
           ROAD TO ALL-STAR
           ====================================================== -->

      <div class="tournament-note">

        <p class="handwritten note note-large note-left">
          one I'm especially proud of ↓
        </p>


        <h3 class="tournament-note-heading">
          Clash for Glory:<br />
          Road to All-Star
        </h3>


        <p>
          A four-season community tournament series leading to a
          10-team All-Star tournament in December.
        </p>

        <p>
          Instead of one tournament deciding everything, teams get
          four separate chances to compete for a place at the All-Star.
        </p>


        <div class="tournament-timeline">

          <!-- CURRENT -->

          <div class="timeline-step current">

            <span class="timeline-current-note">
              we are here ↓
            </span>

            <span class="timeline-label">
              01
            </span>

            <span class="timeline-name">
              Season 1 · Current
            </span>

          </div>


          <div class="timeline-step">

            <span class="timeline-label">
              02
            </span>

            <span class="timeline-name">
              Season 2 · This Month
            </span>

          </div>


          <div class="timeline-step">

            <span class="timeline-label">
              03
            </span>

            <span class="timeline-name">
              Season 3
            </span>

          </div>


          <div class="timeline-step">

            <span class="timeline-label">
              04
            </span>

            <span class="timeline-name">
              Season 4
            </span>

          </div>


          <div class="timeline-step">

            <span class="timeline-label">
              DEC
            </span>

            <span class="timeline-name">
              10-Team All-Star
            </span>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>


      <div class="about-link">

        <a
          href="/portfolio#crossfire-legends"
          class="text-link"
        >
          Full Case Study
          <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        </a>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       02 — BUKALAPAK
       ============================================================ -->

  <section class="project-feature">
    <div class="site-shell">

      <div class="project-heading-row">

        <span class="project-index">
          02
        </span>

        <h2 class="project-title">
          Bukalapak
        </h2>

        <span class="project-date">
          2022 — 2025
        </span>

      </div>


      <p class="project-subtitle">
        EXPGames + Lapakgaming — community, content, creators,
        and gaming events built around the same audience.
      </p>


      <div class="project-details">

        <div class="project-description">

          <p>
            At Bukalapak, my work connected community management
            with gaming content and larger activations.
          </p>

          <p>
            I helped grow EXPGames from an early-stage gaming
            community, developed content around what its audience
            was playing, worked with creators, and helped bring
            that audience into events such as Lapakgaming
            Battle Arena.
          </p>

        </div>


        <dl class="project-facts">

          <div class="project-fact">
            <dt>Projects</dt>
            <dd>EXPGames · Lapakgaming</dd>
          </div>

          <div class="project-fact">
            <dt>Community</dt>
            <dd>Discord · WhatsApp</dd>
          </div>

          <div class="project-fact">
            <dt>Work</dt>
            <dd>Community · Content · Events</dd>
          </div>

          <div class="project-fact">
            <dt>Partners</dt>
            <dd>Creators · Entertainment</dd>
          </div>

        </dl>

      </div>


      <!-- Proof -->

      <div class="proof-list">

        <div class="proof-item">

          <span class="proof-number">
            7,000+
          </span>

          <span class="proof-label">
            members in the EXPGames community
          </span>

        </div>


        <div class="proof-item">

          <span class="proof-number">
            <span class="marker marker-soft">
              +150%
            </span>
          </span>

          <span class="proof-label">
            increase in active community participation within six months
          </span>

        </div>


        <div class="proof-item">

          <span class="proof-number">
            5,000+
          </span>

          <span class="proof-label">
            participants across Lapakgaming Battle Arena
          </span>

        </div>


        <div class="proof-item">

          <span class="proof-number">
            1M+
          </span>

          <span class="proof-label">
            views from gaming content initiatives on YouTube
          </span>

        </div>

      </div>


      <!-- Images -->

      <div class="photo-pair">

        <figure class="pasted-photo rotate-left">

          <span class="photo-tape top-left"></span>

          <img
            src="/images/expgames.png"
            alt="EXPGames gaming community and content"
            loading="lazy"
          />

          <figcaption class="photo-caption">
            community + content
          </figcaption>

        </figure>


        <figure class="polaroid rotate-right">

          <img
            src="/images/lgba.jpg"
            alt="Lapakgaming Battle Arena gaming event"
            loading="lazy"
          />

          <figcaption class="polaroid-caption">
            Lapakgaming Battle Arena
          </figcaption>

        </figure>

      </div>


      <div class="about-link">

        <a
          href="/portfolio#bukalapak"
          class="text-link"
        >
          Full Case Study
          <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        </a>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       03 — WHAT I DO
       ============================================================ -->

  <section class="notebook-section what-i-do">
    <div class="site-shell">

      <div class="section-kicker">

        <span class="section-number">
          03
        </span>

        What I Do

      </div>


      <h2 class="section-title">
        The work behind<br />
        the community.
      </h2>


      <div class="services-list">

        <div class="service-row">

          <span class="service-number">
            01
          </span>

          <h3 class="service-name">
            Community Operations
          </h3>

          <p class="service-description">
            Community setup, Discord, WhatsApp, Facebook, moderation,
            member communication, engagement activities, onboarding,
            and day-to-day operations.
          </p>

        </div>


        <div class="service-row">

          <span class="service-number">
            02
          </span>

          <h3 class="service-name">
            Content &amp; Creators
          </h3>

          <p class="service-description">
            Content planning, community campaigns, creator programs,
            briefs, communication, submission tracking, coordination,
            and reporting.
          </p>

        </div>


        <div class="service-row">

          <span class="service-number">
            03
          </span>

          <h3 class="service-name">
            Events &amp; Tournaments
          </h3>

          <p class="service-description">
            Community events, mini tournaments, scrimmages, larger
            gaming activations, participant communication, promotion,
            and tournament operations.
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>


      <div class="services-note">

        <p class="handwritten note note-left">
          ↳ need some combination of these?
          <br />
          <a href="#contact" class="hand-underline">
            let's talk.
          </a>
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       04 — ABOUT
       ============================================================ -->

  <section
    id="about"
    class="notebook-section about-section"
  >
    <div class="site-shell">

      <div class="section-kicker">

        <span class="section-number">
          04
        </span>

        About

      </div>


      <div class="about-layout">

        <div class="about-heading-wrap">

          <h2 class="about-heading">
            I started in content.<br />

            <span class="marker marker-soft">
              Community made me stay.
            </span>
          </h2>


          <p class="handwritten about-introduction-note">
            Hi, I'm Rizki. ↗
          </p>

        </div>


        <div class="about-copy">

          <p>
            I've spent 10+ years across digital content, gaming,
            and online communities.
          </p>

          <p>
            I started as a content writer, then moved into content
            management before working more deeply with gaming
            communities. Over time, the job became less about
            publishing something for an audience and more about
            working directly with the people on the other side of it.
          </p>

          <p>
            Today, my work can mean answering players, planning content,
            coordinating creators, running Discord and WhatsApp
            communities, collecting feedback, organizing events,
            supporting tournaments, writing announcements, or figuring
            out what the community should do next.
          </p>

          <p>
            My content background still matters. It taught me how to
            explain things clearly and understand what gets people's
            attention. Community work taught me what happens after
            you get it.
          </p>

          <p>
            I'm most interested in communities where people don't
            just join — they
            <span class="hand-underline">
              participate.
            </span>
          </p>


          <div class="about-link">

            <a href="/cv" class="text-link">
              View My CV
              <span class="arrow">↗</span>
            </a>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       05 — CONTACT
       ============================================================ -->

  <section
    id="contact"
    class="contact-section"
  >
    <div class="site-shell">

      <div class="section-kicker">

        <span class="section-number">
          05
        </span>

        Contact

      </div>


      <h2 class="contact-heading">
        Have a community<br />
        that needs someone<br />
        to
        <span class="marker marker-double">
          actually run it?
        </span>
      </h2>


      <div class="contact-bottom">

        <p class="contact-copy">
          If you're building a community, trying to make an existing
          one more active, or need help with content, creators, events,
          or tournament operations, tell me what you're working on.
        </p>


        <div class="contact-action">

          <a
            href="mailto:mail.rizkirn@gmail.com?subject=Community%20Project%20Inquiry"
            class="contact-email"
          >
            mail.rizkirn@gmail.com
          </a>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>